      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "4. From perusal of order dated 28.09.2024 passed in M.R. Case No. 44 of 2023 by learned Principal Judge Family Patna High Court CR. MISC. No.26032 of 2025(7) dt.03-02-2026 Court, Madhubani,\nwhich was filed on behalf of opposite party no. 2, it appears that petitioner was directed to pay a sum of Rs. 9,000/- per month towards maintenance to opposite party no. 2 with effect from the presentation of said application i.e. 28.02.2023, but till date, petitioner has not complied said order and did not pay a single penny to opposite party no. 2.",
